  data: {
    LLM: "1. Play a card from hand to match a card of the same month on the table.\n2. Draw a card from the deck to match another card on the table.\n3. Captured cards are placed in categories: Brights (Kwang), Animals (Yul), Ribbons (Tti), or Junk (Pi).\n4. **Go or Stop**: Once you hit the target score, if you say 'Go', you continue. Each subsequent 'Go' increases your point multiplier but risks 'Go-bak' (losing everything if another player scores).",
    Player: "1. Play a card from hand to match a card of the same month on the table.\n2. Draw a card from the deck to match another card on the table.\n3. Captured cards are placed in categories: Brights (Kwang), Animals (Yul), Ribbons (Tti), or Junk (Pi).\n4. **Go or Stop**: Once you hit the target score, if you say 'Go', you continue. Each subsequent 'Go' increases your point multiplier but risks 'Go-bak' (losing everything if another player scores).",
    objective: "Capture cards to reach a target score (3 points for 3 players, 7 for 2 players) and then decide whether to continue ('Go') or end ('Stop').",
